    old "Check out the original {a=https://paper-pepper.itch.io/softmoney}SoftMoney{/a} on Itch.io!"
    new "Ознакомься с оригиналом {a=https://paper-pepper.itch.io/softmoney}SoftMoney{/a} на Itch.io!"

    # game/script-endings.rpy:83
    old "And while you're at it, maybe give {a=https://shroomychrist-studios.itch.io/bloodmoney}BloodMoney{/a} and {a=https://buwu3.itch.io/llllollll}LoveMoney{/a} a try too?"
    new "И заодно попробуй {a=https://shroomychrist-studios.itch.io/bloodmoney}BloodMoney{/a} и {a=https://buwu3.itch.io/llllollll}LoveMoney{/a} — почему бы и нет?"

    # game/script-endings.rpy:84
    old "Who knows, maybe you'll enjoy those experiences as well!"
    new "Кто знает, может, эти игры тоже тебе понравятся!"